WEBVTT

00:12.750 --> 00:14.880
<b>The holy tree...?</b>

00:16.130 --> 00:17.830
<b>Wait, where am I?</b>

00:18.750 --> 00:19.380
<b>Wha?</b>

00:20.630 --> 00:21.500
<b>Miki...</b>

00:23.750 --> 00:24.790
<b>Miki...</b>

00:26.420 --> 00:27.420
<b>Miki...</b>

00:28.630 --> 00:29.500
<b>Miki.</b>

00:32.380 --> 00:33.580
<b>Ah! Oh! Yes?</b>

00:34.040 --> 00:36.330
<b>We're in the middle of class here, missy!</b>

00:36.330 --> 00:38.250
<b>R-right, sorry...</b>

00:38.250 --> 00:40.250
<b>I was just up so late last night and...</b>

00:40.250 --> 00:42.380
<b>Rebuilding the City – Let the Town 
Get its Spirit Back (Support is vital!)</b>

00:42.500 --> 00:44.920
<b>You weren't even trying to 
sneak that nap, were you?</b>

00:46.040 --> 00:49.000
<b>Okay, Ms. Wakaba, why don't you
continue reading for us, then.</b>

00:49.000 --> 00:49.830
<b>Ah...</b>

00:49.830 --> 00:52.080
<b>Uhhh...</b>

00:53.000 --> 00:55.460
<b>"And so, returning to Earth, human kind..."</b>

00:55.460 --> 00:56.420
<b>We're on the 3rd paragraph on page 28.
"And so, returning to Earth, human kind..."</b>

00:56.420 --> 00:57.920
<b>We're on the 3rd paragraph on page 28.</b>

00:57.920 --> 01:00.710
<b>Well, well, well, so you weren't
paying attention either then, hmm?</b>

01:05.670 --> 01:06.960
<b>Glad that's over!</b>

01:07.210 --> 01:08.880
<b>What was that, Hoshitsuki?</b>

01:11.170 --> 01:14.250
<b>What was up with that weird dream though?</b>

01:14.790 --> 01:16.500
<b>Ah, whatever!</b>

01:25.040 --> 01:30.000
<b>Episode 1
We Can Do It!</b>

01:30.170 --> 01:32.460
<b>C'mon you two, hurry it up!</b>

01:32.460 --> 01:34.170
<b>S-slow down, Miki!</b>

01:34.170 --> 01:36.080
<b>The concert's already started!</b>

01:36.080 --> 01:38.000
<b>This is all your fault, Miki.</b>

01:38.000 --> 01:39.460
<b>First you fall asleep in class,</b>

01:39.460 --> 01:44.380
<b>then you go and make Mrs. Yakumo mad
by literally cheering when class is finished!</b>

01:44.380 --> 01:47.540
<b>What do you want from me?
I was so excited for this concert!</b>

01:47.540 --> 01:49.460
<b>Jeez, look at the time.</b>

01:49.460 --> 01:51.250
<b>If we don't hurry we're going 
to miss the whole thing!</b>

01:51.250 --> 01:54.000
<b>C'mon Subaru, Haruka! 
Time to move those feet!</b>

01:54.000 --> 01:56.080
<b>Ahh! Wait for me, Miki!</b>

01:58.330 --> 02:01.710
<b>Good evening, everyone!</b>

02:02.170 --> 02:04.130
<b>Good evening!</b>

02:04.920 --> 02:09.830
<b>Thank you all for joining us tonight
for f*f's (Fortissimo) tour!</b>

02:10.330 --> 02:13.920
<b>We're going all out right from the start,
so you all better keep up!</b>

02:14.210 --> 02:15.750
<b>Really?</b>

02:15.750 --> 02:17.420
<b>NOW?! You've got to be kidding!</b>

02:17.420 --> 02:18.710
<b>Sorry, but I need you to hurry.</b>

02:18.710 --> 02:20.790
<b>The miasma is growing thicker and thicker.</b>

02:20.790 --> 02:22.670
<b>At this rate the people 
in town are in danger.</b>

02:22.880 --> 02:23.880
<b>You're kidding!</b>

02:23.880 --> 02:25.540
<b>But who was on shift tonight...?</b>

02:25.540 --> 02:28.920
<b>Himukai and the other 2nd years are
off dealing with something else right now.</b>

02:30.290 --> 02:32.130
<b>I'm picking up on a pack of Irous.</b>

02:32.130 --> 02:33.830
<b>Looks like we have more incoming, too.</b>

02:33.830 --> 02:35.630
<b>Increasing warning level from yellow to red!</b>

02:37.170 --> 02:38.830
<b>Hey! Miki! Where are you going?</b>

02:38.830 --> 02:41.080
<b>What are you waiting for, you two?</b>

02:41.080 --> 02:44.290
<b>Let's go take down those Irous
and get back to catch the concert!</b>

02:45.080 --> 02:47.920
<b>Oh my. Looks like there are 
Irous out on the loose.</b>

02:45.080 --> 02:48.170
<b>Irous have shown up,
so I’m gonna go take them down! 
But I’ll totally be there,
so please keep the concert going!</b>

02:48.250 --> 02:49.460
<b>But I’ll totally be there,
so please keep the concert going!
Leave it to me! Woof!</b>

02:48.580 --> 02:49.630
<b>What should we do?</b>

02:49.630 --> 02:51.040
<b>Maybe we should...</b>

02:51.630 --> 02:52.790
<b>I...</b>

02:53.830 --> 02:55.670
<b>We need to have some faith 
in Miki and the others.</b>

02:56.460 --> 02:58.290
<b>I thought you'd say that...</b>

02:58.290 --> 03:02.500
<b>Let's light up this place and be ready
for when they get back, then.</b>

03:02.500 --> 03:03.330
<b>Yeah!</b>

03:04.000 --> 03:06.210
<b>Incoming Irous have been detected.</b>

03:06.210 --> 03:09.170
<b>Everyone please immediately evacuate
to your nearest shelters!</b>

03:09.670 --> 03:11.830
<b>Repeat. Incoming Irous detected...</b>

03:12.670 --> 03:14.460
<b>Momma, I'm scared!</b>

03:14.460 --> 03:16.710
<b>Don't worry, I'm right here with you.</b>

03:18.460 --> 03:20.830
<b>Momma! Momma!</b>

03:30.580 --> 03:32.290
<b>Go on, get out of here while you can!</b>

03:32.290 --> 03:34.000
<b>Th-thank you so much!</b>

03:34.000 --> 03:37.710
<b>Go get 'em, Hoshimori girls!</b>

03:38.080 --> 03:40.080
<b>Let's do this! Subaru! Haruka!</b>

03:40.080 --> 03:40.500
<b>Yeah!</b>

03:40.630 --> 03:41.290
<b>Yeah!</b>

04:28.130 --> 04:30.880
<b>Hoshitsuki, there's an 
abandoned factory up ahead.</b>

04:30.880 --> 04:33.210
<b>Can you try and lure the Irous out that way?</b>

04:33.210 --> 04:35.170
<b>Roger that. I'll see what I can do.</b>

04:43.500 --> 04:45.920
<b>Blooming on the water's surface</b>

04:45.920 --> 04:48.460
<b>It's to the flowers</b>

04:48.830 --> 04:51.460
<b>I spoke with muddied words</b>

04:51.460 --> 04:54.080
<b>As here and now slipped away</b>

04:54.080 --> 04:57.040
<b>My shadow keep in</b>

04:57.040 --> 04:59.920
<b>Broken mirror</b>

04:57.960 --> 04:58.830
<b>Haruka!</b>

04:59.920 --> 05:02.420
<b>Mind is fallen</b>

05:02.420 --> 05:05.330
<b>I can no longer hear</b>

05:04.580 --> 05:06.710
<b>Heh, maybe I overdid it a little...</b>

05:05.330 --> 05:10.000
<b>Your voice singing of our memories</b>

05:07.000 --> 05:09.960
<b>You almost fried the whole lot of us...</b>

05:09.960 --> 05:11.170
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

05:10.000 --> 05:13.080
<b>The voice I wished for</b>

05:13.080 --> 05:15.040
<b>I promise</b>

05:15.040 --> 05:17.630
<b>I will seek it out</b>

05:15.630 --> 05:16.670
<b>Subaru!</b>

05:18.130 --> 05:23.250
<b>Deeper shaking on the boundaries</b>

05:23.460 --> 05:28.500
<b>The skies out there are ever so bright</b>

05:28.920 --> 05:34.420
<b>And to myself there</b>

05:34.420 --> 05:39.420
<b>I will make this vow</b>

05:39.670 --> 05:44.710
<b>Fake out, it rings through my head</b>

05:42.290 --> 05:43.630
<b>Sorry for the wait!</b>

05:45.130 --> 05:50.250
<b>What is this dream anyway?</b>

05:50.500 --> 06:00.000
<b>It leads to a whole new future</b>

06:00.000 --> 06:04.630
<b>Now let's go for it</b>

06:06.830 --> 06:08.710
<b>Let's go, Sakura!</b>

06:08.710 --> 06:10.960
<b>Hang on just one minute there!</b>

06:11.330 --> 06:12.830
<b>Boom!</b>

06:14.170 --> 06:15.000
<b>Huh?</b>

06:16.830 --> 06:19.960
<b>See? That's what you get 
for not thinking ahead.</b>

06:19.960 --> 06:22.460
<b>Sakura, look out!</b>

06:28.000 --> 06:30.290
<b>Woah! Sakura, that was incredible!</b>

06:30.290 --> 06:33.080
<b>Awww, you girls have all the fun!</b>

06:33.080 --> 06:33.790
<b>Huh?</b>

06:33.790 --> 06:35.750
<b>Where am I supposed to make my entrance now?</b>

06:35.750 --> 06:36.710
<b>Whaaaa?
Where am I supposed to make my entrance now?</b>

06:37.080 --> 06:42.210
<b>You just wait, the world's future super idol Urara
is here to dazzle and charm and save the world!</b>

06:44.540 --> 06:46.790
<b>At least wait for me, Urara!</b>

06:47.710 --> 06:50.130
<b>Mimi, they're headed your way!</b>

06:50.130 --> 06:51.670
<b>Do be careful!</b>

06:51.670 --> 06:52.880
<b>Okie dokie!</b>

06:56.540 --> 06:59.500
<b>Don't you dare go picking on my friends!</b>

07:00.830 --> 07:04.130
<b>Gosh, this is even easier than
the game I was playing earlier.</b>

07:04.130 --> 07:07.580
<b>Well that was a work out!</b>

07:07.580 --> 07:10.250
<b>There you go again, treating these missions
like they're just fun and games...</b>

07:10.710 --> 07:13.460
<b>Now now Asuha, lighten up!</b>

07:14.460 --> 07:17.380
<b>I wanted to go out and pick up some
cute new accessories today!</b>

07:17.380 --> 07:20.420
<b>Now's not the time, Nozomi!</b>

07:20.670 --> 07:22.000
<b>Uh, Yuri.</b>

07:22.000 --> 07:22.630
<b>Huh?</b>

07:24.670 --> 07:27.290
<b>Sorry. I was trying to warn you.</b>

07:27.290 --> 07:29.250
<b>A little late now, don't you think?!</b>

07:29.460 --> 07:30.790
<b>Ah! Sorry!</b>

07:30.790 --> 07:32.460
<b>No worries, Miki.</b>

07:32.460 --> 07:33.920
<b>Look out, dead ahead!</b>

07:38.500 --> 07:39.880
<b>Get it together!</b>

07:41.540 --> 07:42.420
<b>Now's your chance!</b>

07:42.420 --> 07:43.210
<b>Got it!</b>

07:52.040 --> 07:52.790
<b>Mission Complete</b>

07:53.130 --> 07:56.630
<b>Elimination of all Irous targets confirmed.</b>

07:56.630 --> 07:58.170
<b>Good work, girls.</b>

08:01.710 --> 08:05.170
<b>Mission Complete</b>

08:01.920 --> 08:05.170
<b>What? No no, that can't be...</b>

08:05.170 --> 08:09.670
<b>I'm sorry to be the bearer of bad news,
but just take a look at the data here.</b>

08:09.670 --> 08:10.080
<b>Mission Complete</b>

08:11.630 --> 08:12.750
<b>And this is...?</b>

08:12.750 --> 08:17.210
<b>It's a graph comparing the scope of attacks and
the amount of time taken to defeat them.</b>

08:18.460 --> 08:25.290
<b>Again, I hate to say it, but it looks like
the girls might be losing their touch.</b>

08:26.790 --> 08:28.670
<b>Oh, Mrs. Mitsurugi!</b>

08:28.670 --> 08:32.500
<b>Which means the problem is that they have lost
any sense of urgency in their missions.</b>

08:32.500 --> 08:34.040
<b>Now surely that's not true!</b>

08:34.040 --> 08:39.040
<b>The girls have grown tremendously
through both of the major battles they have faced.</b>

08:39.670 --> 08:44.210
<b>I know it was because of their bravery
that we still have this very world of ours today.</b>

08:44.210 --> 08:45.290
<b>But...</b>

08:45.290 --> 08:49.830
<b>We can't ignore how they have
since succumbed to increased carelessness.</b>

08:49.830 --> 08:53.330
<b>They must remember that they are
always in the face of real danger.</b>

08:54.630 --> 08:56.920
<b>That'll be enough, Itsuki.</b>

08:57.250 --> 08:58.330
<b>Ms. President!</b>

08:58.330 --> 09:01.290
<b>Our fight against the 
Irous is a merciless one.</b>

09:01.540 --> 09:05.210
<b>But that is why as their teachers
we must at times be strict.</b>

09:05.210 --> 09:10.170
<b>And at times be the moral 
support that they need.</b>

09:10.790 --> 09:15.630
<b>Lest we lose even a single 
soul to the battles ahead.</b>

09:18.500 --> 09:19.580
<b>Sweets & Me</b>

09:18.500 --> 09:20.000
<b>Oh, Kanon?!</b>

09:19.580 --> 09:20.290
<b>Sweets & Me
A Collection of Unique Sweets
The slightest change can make all the difference!</b>

09:20.460 --> 09:23.830
<b>Sorry about not being able to
jump into battle with you all earlier.</b>

09:23.830 --> 09:27.330
<b>Oh, no! Not at all! Work is work!</b>

09:27.330 --> 09:30.330
<b>To the members
of Fortissimo
From everyone at
Hoshimori Class</b>

09:27.710 --> 09:31.500
<b>We've got a radio show and
some interviews coming up after this,</b>

09:31.500 --> 09:34.210
<b>so it'll be a while before we get back.</b>

09:34.210 --> 09:37.380
<b>That's perfectly okay.
We'll take care of everything here!</b>

09:38.330 --> 09:41.330
<b>All right, well just know that we'll have
lots of goodies for you when we get there.</b>

09:42.000 --> 09:43.710
<b>I'm sure the girls will be 
super excited to hear that!</b>

09:43.710 --> 09:46.710
<b>Oh, and by the way, that 
concert was just amazing!</b>

09:46.710 --> 09:49.040
<b>You two were so in sync with each other.</b>

09:49.710 --> 09:51.670
<b>But of course!</b>

09:51.670 --> 09:56.670
<b>Just between us, Kanon went overboard on
the practicing when she heard you were coming.</b>

09:56.670 --> 10:02.040
<b>What! Hey! Nuh-uh! That's not true, I swear!</b>

10:02.670 --> 10:04.080
<b>Really now?</b>

10:04.080 --> 10:05.710
<b>Let's see, there was that interlude step...</b>

10:05.710 --> 10:08.130
<b>Then that turn... Oh, and then...</b>

10:08.290 --> 10:09.830
<b>W-well what about you, then?</b>

10:09.830 --> 10:12.500
<b>Singing as crystal-clear as ever.</b>

10:13.420 --> 10:14.920
<b>Why thank you!</b>

10:15.290 --> 10:18.170
<b>That was just 'cause you were
there by my side, sweetie.</b>

10:19.380 --> 10:20.670
<b>Shiho...</b>

10:21.460 --> 10:23.960
<b>The two of you are just so adorable together.</b>

10:24.460 --> 10:26.250
<b>R-right! Yes!</b>

10:26.250 --> 10:28.250
<b>Well, if anything comes up, let us know.</b>

10:28.670 --> 10:30.170
<b>Wait, Kanon...?!</b>

10:32.460 --> 10:34.460
<b>Those two...</b>

10:36.170 --> 10:37.630
<b>Hoshitsuki</b>

10:36.170 --> 10:39.960
<b>Miki, you better get to sleep
if you don't wanna be late tomorrow.</b>

10:39.960 --> 10:42.040
<b>I know, I know!</b>

10:45.790 --> 10:50.420
<b>As head of the school disciplinary committee,
I will not permit even one second of tardiness!</b>

10:47.830 --> 10:50.420
<b>Discipline</b>

10:50.420 --> 10:52.500
<b>Yikes, dictator-in-the-making is at it again!</b>

10:50.420 --> 10:59.380
<b>Shinjugamine
Girls’ School</b>

10:52.500 --> 10:54.420
<b>I do not want to get caught up with her.</b>

10:55.000 --> 10:58.250
<b>You over there! Move along, now! Move, move!</b>

10:58.250 --> 10:59.380
<b>Yeah, yeah.</b>

11:01.790 --> 11:04.170
<b>Yet another all-nighter...</b>

11:04.670 --> 11:06.250
<b>Teamwork, huh.</b>

11:06.830 --> 11:08.380
<b>What's on your mind all of a sudden?</b>

11:08.380 --> 11:12.170
<b>I was just thinking about how in tune with
one another Kanon and Shiho were last night.</b>

11:12.170 --> 11:15.500
<b>Do you think we all come 
anywhere close to that level?</b>

11:15.710 --> 11:17.500
<b>Like when we were fighting 
together last night?</b>

11:17.500 --> 11:20.330
<b>You know, I've been thinking 
about that myself...</b>

11:20.630 --> 11:24.000
<b>Yeah, so, I think we should all
get together for some training!</b>

11:24.000 --> 11:25.000
<b>Training?</b>

11:25.000 --> 11:28.830
<b>We need to start paying attention to our formations
and stuff if we want to get stronger!</b>

11:29.170 --> 11:30.710
<b>Well in that case...</b>

11:30.710 --> 11:32.040
<b>I'm down!</b>

11:32.330 --> 11:34.920
<b>Okay then, here goes, ten laps!</b>

11:34.920 --> 11:38.250
<b>You gotta be kidding me! Ten, really?!</b>

11:38.460 --> 11:39.710
<b>Hey, wait...!</b>

11:41.500 --> 11:44.210
<b>Hoshimori Level-Up Training - Outline</b>

11:41.500 --> 11:44.210
<b>Well then. I guess they didn't need
any encouragement after all.</b>

11:52.960 --> 11:56.960
<b>Miki Hoshitsuki (1st Year HS)
Birthday: March 15th
Sign: Pisces
Blood Type: O
Measurements: 83/54/82
Height: 156cm
Weight: 45kg
Hobby: Trying various restaurants
Dream job: Pâtissier
Favorite food: Tiramisu
Dislikes: Bitter food</b>

11:56.960 --> 12:00.960
<b>Haruka Narumi (1st Year HS)
Birthday: September 23rd
Sign: Libra
Blood Type: A
Measurements: 85/57/85
Height: 155cm
Weight: 43kg
Hobby: Listening to music
Dream job: Doctor
Favorite food: Strawberry tart
Dislikes: Nothing in particular</b>

12:00.960 --> 12:06.170
<b>Hoshimori Class</b>

12:01.380 --> 12:03.540
<b>But wait, that isn't even the best part.</b>

12:03.540 --> 12:04.630
<b>Tell me, tell me!</b>

12:04.630 --> 12:05.790
<b>What?!</b>

12:08.630 --> 12:10.170
<b>What is it?</b>

12:11.290 --> 12:12.540
<b>Oh...</b>

12:12.540 --> 12:14.580
<b>Oh my... This is...</b>

12:12.540 --> 12:15.000
<b>Notice from the Shinjugamine School Council
The following clubs (and groups, gatherings)
have been proposed for closure.
-Shogi Club 
-PC Club
-Rakugo Studies Club
-Speed-walking Club</b>

12:17.000 --> 12:19.630
<b>Student Council Room</b>

12:17.000 --> 12:20.290
<b>So, seeing as how membership has dwindled,
and how you haven't been very active,</b>

12:19.630 --> 12:22.080
<b>List of possible clubs to be disbanded
Shogi Club
PC Club</b>

12:20.290 --> 12:26.130
<b>it is only natural that the PC Club and
the Shogi Club be next in line for closure.</b>

12:26.330 --> 12:27.290
<b>OBJECTION!</b>

12:27.290 --> 12:28.790
<b>Now listen here.</b>

12:28.790 --> 12:32.750
<b>You might be our president, but you can't just
spring this sort of stuff on us like this.</b>

12:33.000 --> 12:38.580
<b>We students will not stand for this blatant
oppression of our right to free club assembly.</b>

12:38.830 --> 12:42.380
<b>Be that as it may, your clubs still have
only a single member.</b>

12:43.540 --> 12:47.130
<b>You do not appear to be working
to draw in any new members,</b>

12:47.130 --> 12:50.080
<b>and you engage in no activities
that let your club stand out.</b>

12:50.920 --> 12:52.880
<b>That's...! It's not that bad!</b>

12:52.880 --> 12:54.460
<b>Oh yes, indeed.</b>

12:54.830 --> 12:58.790
<b>She just sits there playing FPSs or mobile games
with her internet friends all day.</b>

12:58.790 --> 13:06.000
<b>While Sakura just loafs around out there
drinking tea and napping away with Hinata.</b>

13:06.000 --> 13:08.460
<b>So we had a spy among us, did we...?</b>

13:10.330 --> 13:12.130
<b>Well? Care to explain yourselves?</b>

13:12.130 --> 13:15.250
<b>They're my friends! My companions!</b>

13:15.250 --> 13:17.830
<b>I can't just abandon them, 
right? Not even online!</b>

13:17.830 --> 13:23.250
<b>I am awaiting the spark of inspiration
that will take my shogi tactics to a new level!</b>

13:23.500 --> 13:27.790
<b>Indeed, it is only a matter of time
before I devise my great Fujimiya System!</b>

13:29.130 --> 13:31.670
<b>If you're going to be dramatic, 
at least face this way.</b>

13:32.460 --> 13:36.460
<b>Be that as it may, I will admit
I sprung this on you all too suddenly.</b>

13:36.460 --> 13:38.670
<b>List of possible clubs to be disbanded
Shogi Club
PC Club</b>

13:36.460 --> 13:38.670
<b>As such, allow me to postpone 
your clubs' closures.</b>

13:38.670 --> 13:39.790
<b>Really?!</b>

13:39.790 --> 13:41.460
<b>But under a few conditions.</b>

13:41.880 --> 13:42.880
<b>Which are...?</b>

13:42.880 --> 13:44.970
<b>By the end of the semester you must at least find
</b>

13:44.970 --> 13:48.650
<b>new members or behave in a manner suitable of a club.</b>

13:48.650 --> 13:51.930
<b>Failure to do so will result 
in their immediate closure.</b>

13:52.210 --> 13:53.210
<b>Got it?</b>

13:54.670 --> 13:57.130
<b>Student Council Room</b>

13:55.670 --> 13:58.920
<b>Jeez, what's her deal?
We're on the same team, right?</b>

13:58.920 --> 14:01.500
<b>She could at least cut us some slack!</b>

14:01.500 --> 14:03.250
<b>She's gone mad with power.</b>

14:03.250 --> 14:05.000
<b>I'm not sure that talk really 
got through to them at all.</b>

14:09.460 --> 14:10.830
<b>You can do it!</b>

14:10.830 --> 14:11.920
<b>Here!</b>

14:14.040 --> 14:16.380
<b>Nice moves, Subaru! There's our opening!</b>

14:18.380 --> 14:19.250
<b>Subaru!</b>

14:22.250 --> 14:23.420
<b>You feeling okay, Subaru?</b>

14:23.420 --> 14:25.670
<b>Yeah, sorry. Timing was just off.</b>

14:25.670 --> 14:26.670
<b>Let's get this next one!</b>

14:26.670 --> 14:27.500
<b>Got it!</b>

14:29.080 --> 14:30.000
<b>Hmm?</b>

14:30.540 --> 14:33.210
<b>I wasn't even able to go 
pick one up in the end...</b>

14:33.630 --> 14:36.210
<b>But this weekend, I'm getting 
my shopping in for sure.</b>

14:37.040 --> 14:38.330
<b>You do that.</b>

14:38.460 --> 14:41.580
<b>You know, I found the cutest
little accessory for you, Kurumi.</b>

14:41.580 --> 14:42.830
<b>Really?</b>

14:43.040 --> 14:45.250
<b>You should come with me next time!</b>

14:45.250 --> 14:50.750
<b>Nozomi, are you here to chat,
or are you here to help with this replanting?</b>

14:50.750 --> 14:52.380
<b>You're one to talk.</b>

14:52.380 --> 14:54.210
<b>What's with that outfit?</b>

14:54.750 --> 14:58.580
<b>I...! This is just because I 
came straight from practice!</b>

14:58.580 --> 15:00.170
<b>Did you really need that shinai too, though?</b>

15:00.290 --> 15:02.670
<b>A warrior's soul flows through their blade.</b>

15:02.670 --> 15:04.920
<b>With this I am whole.</b>

15:04.920 --> 15:06.040
<b>Uh-huh.</b>

15:06.040 --> 15:09.670
<b>I guess I feel a little better when I've got
a new bit of jewelry on too, though.</b>

15:09.670 --> 15:10.830
<b>Don't you dare compare the two!</b>

15:10.830 --> 15:11.710
<b>What? Why not?</b>

15:11.710 --> 15:12.670
<b>This and that are completely different!</b>

15:12.670 --> 15:13.380
<b>You two are quite the pair, aren't you?
No they aren't!</b>

15:13.380 --> 15:14.630
<b>You two are quite the pair, aren't you?
Yes. They. ARE!</b>

15:14.630 --> 15:15.500
<b>Huh?</b>

15:15.500 --> 15:17.710
<b>How do you figure?</b>

15:18.040 --> 15:20.290
<b>You fight because you're close, right?</b>

15:20.920 --> 15:22.920
<b>That's what the flowers are saying.</b>

15:23.920 --> 15:25.540
<b>Wha-?! No-!</b>

15:27.960 --> 15:31.420
<b>Ms. President, the preparations you
asked about are now complete.</b>

15:31.420 --> 15:32.790
<b>Thank you, Itsuki.</b>

15:32.790 --> 15:38.040
<b>But with no history on file,
if it wasn't for your order I would never...</b>

15:38.750 --> 15:41.040
<b>We'll discuss the details 
when the time comes.</b>

15:41.750 --> 15:43.040
<b>As you wish.</b>

15:43.460 --> 15:44.880
<b>Excuse me, then.</b>

15:47.750 --> 15:51.580
<b>I just hope we can act before 
things get out of hand...</b>

15:53.750 --> 15:55.880
<b>There are still two left!</b>

15:56.250 --> 16:00.790
<b>Why do they always have to show up
when we're on duty?!</b>

16:05.250 --> 16:06.380
<b>Sheesh!</b>

16:06.380 --> 16:08.500
<b>Wow, that was amazing Urara!</b>

16:08.500 --> 16:09.710
<b>I'm always amazing!</b>

16:09.710 --> 16:10.580
<b>Wha-?!</b>

16:10.580 --> 16:15.670
<b>I'm the super star idol 
of the future, am I not?</b>

16:16.130 --> 16:19.040
<b>I-I think I've heard about enough of that...</b>

16:23.380 --> 16:25.460
<b>Oh, now you've made me mad!</b>

16:26.000 --> 16:28.380
<b>C'mon Kokomi, let's show 'em what's what!</b>

16:28.380 --> 16:29.210
<b>Yeah!</b>

16:38.830 --> 16:40.210
<b>That's the last of 'em!</b>

16:40.210 --> 16:42.790
<b>Good work, girls. Head on back now.</b>

16:42.790 --> 16:43.710
<b>Roger that.</b>

16:44.460 --> 16:46.080
<b>Well? How was that?</b>

16:48.170 --> 16:50.960
<b>I think they might be taking things
a bit more seriously again.</b>

16:51.380 --> 16:54.670
<b>I know that was only a low rank Irous,
but still, for just the two of them, it wasn't bad.</b>

16:54.670 --> 16:56.880
<b>Yes, I'm sure that played a part of it.</b>

16:56.880 --> 17:00.380
<b>It's like they say, though. 
Slow and steady, right?</b>

17:00.380 --> 17:04.630
<b>The reality though, is that rough and ready
beats slow and steady.</b>

17:06.880 --> 17:11.290
<b>That's why I am quite convinced
they need a new round of training.</b>

17:11.830 --> 17:15.380
<b>It's for their own good, really.</b>

17:17.000 --> 17:19.210
<b>I suppose so...</b>

17:20.880 --> 17:24.000
<b>Well then, we'll see to it tomorrow.</b>

17:24.380 --> 17:25.380
<b>Yes!</b>

17:28.040 --> 17:32.460
<b>In today's training you will be divided up by grades
and pitted against one another.</b>

17:32.630 --> 17:35.920
<b>Aww man, today was a limited-time
online event for my game, too...</b>

17:36.330 --> 17:41.380
<b>I have specially designed the weapons you will
use today to be completely harmless.</b>

17:41.630 --> 17:45.380
<b>So feel free to go all 
out. You won't get hurt.</b>

17:48.630 --> 17:51.920
<b>First up is our high school 3rd years
versus the middle school 1st years.</b>

17:52.830 --> 17:57.330
<b>Don't expect me to hold back just because
this is a drill. Now bring it on.</b>

17:57.330 --> 17:58.670
<b>I'll do my best!</b>

17:58.670 --> 18:00.500
<b>And I won't go down without a fight!</b>

18:00.670 --> 18:01.830
<b>This is pretty intense, with 
us all divided up like this.</b>

18:01.830 --> 18:03.920
<b>Hinata you're so adorable!
This is pretty intense, with us all divided up like this.</b>

18:03.920 --> 18:04.210
<b>Hinata you're so adorable!
Yeah, but these teams are hardly fair...</b>

18:04.210 --> 18:06.130
<b>Just come give me a big hug if you get to scared, okay?
Yeah, but these teams are hardly fair...</b>

18:06.130 --> 18:08.000
<b>Just come give me a big hug 
if you get to scared, okay?</b>

18:09.330 --> 18:10.540
<b>Teacher!</b>

18:11.290 --> 18:12.920
<b>What's the matter, Tsubuzaki?</b>

18:13.460 --> 18:18.790
<b>These teams are super unbalanced,
so I'm gonna hop over to the middle school team.</b>

18:18.790 --> 18:20.170
<b>What? But that...</b>

18:20.170 --> 18:21.750
<b>Fine by me.</b>

18:21.750 --> 18:24.330
<b>Oh, you are just vicious, Asuha!</b>

18:24.330 --> 18:25.790
<b>Get off, Renge!
You sure about this, Renge?</b>

18:25.790 --> 18:28.290
<b>We're supposed to be taking this seriously, here!
Yes, ma'am! It will be fine.</b>

18:28.670 --> 18:30.290
<b>And so, well, here I am!</b>

18:30.290 --> 18:32.750
<b>Yay! Anko's on our side!</b>

18:32.750 --> 18:34.040
<b>Heh, heh, heh!</b>

18:34.040 --> 18:38.670
<b>Who woulda thought we'd get our payback
for the whole club trouble business so fast?</b>

18:38.670 --> 18:40.250
<b>Indeed.</b>

18:40.250 --> 18:42.040
<b>And to both of them.</b>

18:42.500 --> 18:45.250
<b>Wow, are they REALLY...</b>

18:45.250 --> 18:46.250
<b>Oh jeez...</b>

18:46.250 --> 18:48.330
<b>Ready? Begin!</b>

18:48.500 --> 18:49.920
<b>She who strikes first...!</b>

18:50.580 --> 18:52.500
<b>C'mon, Asuha!</b>

18:53.880 --> 18:54.380
<b>Nice, Asuha!</b>

18:54.380 --> 18:55.330
<b>Prepare yourselves!
Nice, Asuha!</b>

18:55.330 --> 18:56.330
<b>Prepare yourselves!
Sakura and Anko are really raring to go, too.</b>

18:56.330 --> 18:58.080
<b>Oh nooo! Help me, Asuha!
Sakura and Anko are really raring to go, too.</b>

18:58.080 --> 18:58.710
<b>Oh nooo! Help me, Asuha!</b>

18:58.710 --> 18:59.040
<b>Handle that yourself!</b>

18:59.040 --> 19:00.250
