<b>Time! It's a draw!</b>

19:05.710 --> 19:07.630
<b>Alright, a tie! Woohoo!</b>

19:07.630 --> 19:10.130
<b>Whew, that was close!</b>

19:10.460 --> 19:12.210
<b>A tie, huh?</b>

19:12.210 --> 19:15.670
<b>Ah well, I suppose that's 
good enough for today.</b>

19:16.080 --> 19:18.790
<b>You lucked out.</b>

19:18.790 --> 19:21.170
<b>If we had only 3 more minutes...</b>

19:22.210 --> 19:24.580
<b>Yet you two seem to be 
the worse for the wear.</b>

19:24.580 --> 19:26.170
<b>Sh-shut up.</b>

19:26.500 --> 19:27.330
<b>Come on now.</b>

19:27.330 --> 19:29.290
<b>I don't need sympathy from the enemy!</b>

19:29.290 --> 19:30.630
<b>Yeah, you tell her!</b>

19:32.130 --> 19:35.420
<b>I talked with the President 
about your clubs, okay?</b>

19:35.420 --> 19:39.080
<b>But! You need to whip 
things into shape still.</b>

19:44.920 --> 19:45.960
<b>Oh, Asuha!</b>

19:45.960 --> 19:49.210
<b>I knew you'd come through!
Oh, Asuha!</b>

19:50.170 --> 19:51.920
<b>Time for our second match.</b>

19:51.920 --> 19:56.830
<b>Next is the 2nd grade middle schoolers,
but with Himukai to even things out.</b>

19:56.830 --> 19:58.080
<b>Victory is ours!</b>

19:58.080 --> 19:59.210
<b>But of course!</b>

19:59.210 --> 19:59.960
<b>You know it!</b>

20:00.420 --> 20:02.330
<b>You ready, high school team?</b>

20:02.330 --> 20:03.210
<b>Ready!</b>

20:03.210 --> 20:05.420
<b>Time to show off how much 
we've been practicing!</b>

20:05.420 --> 20:06.630
<b>Let's give this a go!</b>

20:08.920 --> 20:09.710
<b>Begin!</b>

20:11.880 --> 20:13.380
<b>What are you trying to pull?</b>

20:14.250 --> 20:16.130
<b>You'll have to face me, Yuri!</b>

20:16.130 --> 20:18.330
<b>Subaru, why do you have to be so close!</b>

20:18.330 --> 20:19.500
<b>Sorry, Mimi!</b>

20:23.210 --> 20:24.170
<b>Not bad.</b>

20:24.170 --> 20:24.920
<b>Huh?</b>

20:25.130 --> 20:27.880
<b>They read Yuri and the whole team</b>

20:27.880 --> 20:32.210
