20:32.210 --> 20:35.500
<b>Oh my, they're all just so adorable!</b>

20:35.710 --> 20:37.920
<b>So this is how practice pays off, huh...</b>

20:37.920 --> 20:40.630
<b>They've got a ways to go to get back
to where they used to be, though.</b>

20:45.080 --> 20:46.170
<b>There's our chance!</b>

20:46.170 --> 20:47.080
