20:51.630 --> 20:53.290
<b>Nicely done, Mimi!</b>

20:57.750 --> 20:59.330
<b>Huh?</b>

21:01.000 --> 21:03.380
<b>Time! The middle schoolers win.</b>

21:03.380 --> 21:05.040
<b>Jeez, come on, Miki!</b>

21:05.040 --> 21:06.460
<b>B-but...!</b>

21:06.460 --> 21:07.880
<b>Wowie, Mimi!</b>

21:08.710 --> 21:10.130
<b>Thanks!</b>

21:10.460 --> 21:12.080
<b>How did you get in here?</b>

21:12.670 --> 21:15.330
<b>This facility is strictly off limits to those
not part of the Hoshimori class.</b>

21:16.080 --> 21:18.170
<b>Stop right there or I'll-</b>

21:20.380 --> 21:21.500
<b>This is bad!</b>

21:22.380 --> 21:23.880
<b>That's quite enough.</b>

21:25.630 --> 21:28.580
<b>I do not recall granting you 
permission to join in here.</b>

21:28.580 --> 21:31.210
<b>Ms. President, look out! She's dangerous!</b>

21:32.000 --> 21:33.500
<b>Everything is fine.</b>

21:33.500 --> 21:37.080
<b>I'm sorry this is how I must do so,</b>

21:37.080 --> 21:41.000
<b>but allow me to introduce 
you to your newest member.</b>

21:48.420 --> 21:50.790
<b>I'm Misaki...</b>

21:52.080 --> 21:55.460
<b>She's our newest squad member?</b>

21:57.750 --> 22:03.790
<b>Now among the stars that stretch as far as the eye can see,
find the constellation of your dreams</b>

22:03.790 --> 22:12.210
<b>Bring your hearts together 
and someday it will come true</b>

22:20.500 --> 22:25.460
<b>Are you ready to run for it?</b>

22:25.920 --> 22:31.000
<b>The road is long, but you've 
got your friends with you</b>

22:31.420 --> 22:35.750
<b>Instead of just making faces and worrying</b>

22:35.750 --> 22:40.670
<b>Just go in head-first with a smile</b>

22:41.250 --> 22:46.710
<b>As hearts cross even in mere passing</b>

22:46.710 --> 22:49.420
<b>They will grow into deeper bonds</b>

22:49.420 --> 22:56.540
<b>Bring them together as one and find 
the power to take on the future</b>

22:57.210 --> 23:03.040
<b>Now look up to the stars as far as the eye can see
and keep chasing that dream</b>

23:03.040 --> 23:08.460
<b>That outreached hand will 
encourage you not to give up</b>

23:08.460 --> 23:13.960
<b>No matter how many hundreds of 
tries it takes, you're not alone</b>

23:13.960 --> 23:21.000
<b>You can do it, look up, 
there's surely a starry sky</b>

23:21.000 --> 23:23.830
<b>Your dreams will come true</b>

23:26.630 --> 23:31.880
<b>Misaki joined our team and the whole lot of us
are now headed out for a team retreat.</b>

23:31.880 --> 23:35.630
<b>But Misaki's having a hard time
working along with everyone.</b>

23:36.000 --> 23:38.000
<b>Next time: "Is That What Gets You?"</b>

23:36.000 --> 23:41.000
<b>Next Episode
Is That What Gets You?
Leave it to me! Woof!</b>

